1:1 COMMENT "# cli_errors.z -- cli.parse over argument lists built in the program."
1:70 EOL "\n"
2:1 COMMENT "# A token that starts with `-` and matches no registered flag or option is"
2:75 EOL "\n"
3:1 COMMENT "# unknownFlag whatever its length (`-q` as much as `--quiet` or `-vq`), and"
3:76 EOL "\n"
4:1 COMMENT "# every error arm carries the offending token: it is copied before the"
4:71 EOL "\n"
5:1 COMMENT "# consumed argument list is freed. A short option ending a bundle (`-vo`)"
5:74 EOL "\n"
6:1 COMMENT "# takes the next token as its value, and is missingValue without one. Each"
6:75 EOL "\n"
7:1 COMMENT "# error line ends with the sentence `errorText` gives for it. Position 0 stands"
7:80 EOL "\n"
8:1 COMMENT "# for the program name and is never parsed. The help text closes the run, one"
8:78 EOL "\n"
9:1 COMMENT "# section per kind."
9:20 EOL "\n"
10:1 EOL "\n"
